  "contentSummary": {
    "design.md": "D14 appended: seat credentials are not vault identities; local seat naming disjoint from match/spectator seats (CF-S-8: no reseat path); operator password per write with operation-id replay and generation CAS; per-mint seat password, no unlock session, ordinary unscoped token; route-wide pre-KDF throttle, one in-flight mint per seat, durable lockout (Root-recommended 10/5 per minute, 5 failures/60 s); revocation at next mint or renewal, issued bearer keeps original lifetime (max 1 h), no eviction; re-provision rotates key and playerId, ordinary re-admission; loopback/same-origin topology, operator impersonation and shared-OS disclosure; B15/PRIV-1 holds; pending owner questions with Root-recommended answers.",
    "specs/user-identity/spec.md": "ADDED Local Seat Credentials Are Not Vault Identities (2 scenarios).",
    "specs/player-identity/spec.md": "ADDED Password-Verified Local Seat Token Mint (2 scenarios); ADDED Local Seat Revocation and Re-provision (2 scenarios).",
    "specs/coop-campaign-sync/spec.md": "ADDED Co-op Entry Credential Choice and Recovery (3 scenarios)."
  },
